{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人高海寧（高Ling）、周嘉洛及朱敏瀚（朱仔）擔任主持無綫全新旅遊節目《Grand 住去首爾》今晚（31日）首播，他們到了首爾聖水洞一間極具人氣的「靚仔Cafe」，顧名思義，所有男店員都是「顏值在線」，高Ling特別單拖到該餐廳「朝聖」。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:11.454418+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T11:01:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.064371+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:30:42.064371+00:00","content_hash":"a5226469c21f214793f2b21677fb01ee3bcf6b766a26ab5f3d80b4d554a1314e","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}